<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Email Verification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .otp-code {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 15px;
            font-size: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            font-family: monospace;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Verify Your Email Address</h2>
        <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
        <p>Welcome to {{appName}}! To complete your registration, please use the following verification code:</p>
        
        <div class="otp-code">
            {{otp}}
        </div>
        
        <p>This code will expire in {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes.</p>
        
        <p>If you didn't create an account with us, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
